T*
(Issue 5.1: No Sound / Unresponsive Audio AUD-NOS-01) Tj
T*
(1. Verify source audio setting is set to PCM or Dolby Digital \(RAW Bitstream output without) Tj
T*
(eARC target may cause) Tj
T*
(silence\).) Tj
T*
(2. Ensure Bluetooth Audio Output option is toggled to "Internal Speakers" under Audio) Tj
